  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest for People People for Forest - PNG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PNG programme focuses on combatting forest crime by using the PNG&#x2019;s legal system, and to ensure that banks and investors avoid funding that allows forest crimes and violations of humanrights of IPLCs. Tackeling forest crime contribute to reduced deforestation and biodiversity loss in PNG.</narrative>
  </description>
